# Impeccable design context (local only). PRODUCT.md is the product record an
# init interview produced (positioning, audience, open decisions); .impeccable/
# holds its workflow config plus the generated design.json sidecar; DESIGN.md is
# the visual-system reference extracted from src/webui.html for agents to read.
# All three are reference for whoever (or whatever) works here next, not firmware
# - same no-push policy as Implementation plans/ and site/. The MIT grant in
# LICENSE is the public half.
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md
.impeccable/

# graphify knowledge-graph tooling and outputs (local only)
graphify-out/
graphify-watch.bat

# landing-page prototype (local only - not part of the firmware repo)
site/

